#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56"
msgid "How to Play Shoot-Out:"
msgstr "Cómo jugar Shoot-Out:"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68"
msgid "In Shoot-Out, the score for the numbers you hit are added up."
msgstr "En el Shoot-Out, se suman los puntos de los números que aciertes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "80"
msgid "When all rounds are concluded, the player with the higher score is declared the winner."
msgstr "Cuando todas las rondas hayan concluido, el jugador con más puntos se declara ganador."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92"
msgid "Scores for Shoot-Out are calculated differently than in regular darts.\\r\nSections other than bull's-eye:\\r\n\\r\nNumber that was hit\\r\n\\r\n×\\r\n(Single: 1, Double: 2, Triple: 3)\\r\n×\\r\nNumber of sections hit (other than bull's-eye)\\r\nBull's-eye:\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n(Outer Bull: 25, Inner Bull: 50)\\r\n\\r\n×\\r\nNumber of sections hit (other than bull's-eye)"
msgstr "En el Shoot-Out, los puntos se calculan diferente a los dardos normales.\\r\nPara secciones que no son la diana:\\r\n\\r\nNúmero al que le atinaste\\r\n\\r\n×\\r\n(Simple: 1, Doble: 2, Triple: 3)\\r\n×\\r\nNúmero de secciones acertadas (sin contar la diana)\\r\nDiana:\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n(Anillo exterior: 25, Centro: 50)\\r\n\\r\n×\\r\nNúmero de secciones acertadas (sin contar la diana)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104"
msgid "If you still have rounds remaining after hitting all of the numbers, you can continue to target the bull's-eye until you run out of rounds."
msgstr "Si te quedan rondas después de acertar todos los números, puedes seguir lanzando a la diana hasta que se acaben las rondas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116"
msgid "Have fun and give it your all."
msgstr "Diviértete y da lo mejor de ti."

